        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Isaka owaco ri Yakobo ni, “Keli ran riŋo moro, ŋey acami riŋo pa wodan, t'amiyin silwany.” Ameno Yakobo okelo bonge, aka ocamo, to kelo rigo vini bende to madho. ",
