          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno ocore cegin to cwiyo lembi bamere, aka Isaka oŋweyo nangin pere, aka omiyo go silwany ka waco ama:",
