          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tekin Isaka tieko miyo Yakobo silwany, munyo nyaka Yakobo oeye ruwaŋ bamere Isaka, Esau omin go odwoko wok i dwar pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
