          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bende otedo cemo moro mamit to tero ri bamere. Aka owaco ri bamere ni, “Weyi baba woay, aka wocam riŋo pa wode, ŋey womiyan silwany.”",
          "type": "text",
