        {
          "text": "Isaka ocako kirin gi derino, aka owaco ni, “Ŋa to, m'oneko ogwaŋ to kelo ran, acamo je mafodi ikibino aka atieko miyo go silwany? Ey, aka go labedo gi silwany.”",
